  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grenada OECS Education Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Grenada OECS Education Development Project was restructured following Hurricane Ivan.  The original project development objective was changed.  The new objectives are to: (i) increase equitable access to secondary education, including replacing and rehabilitating secondary schools damaged by the passage of Hurricane Ivan on September 7, 2004; (ii) improve the quality and efficiency of Secondary Education, and (iii) strengthen the institutional capacity of the education sector.</narrative>
  </description>
